{"id":"n90220-1-8","stage":4,"title":"전무후무 · 空前绝后","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n90220-1-8-1","ko":"어젯밤에 옆집에 강도가 들었다면서요?","zh":"听说昨晚隔壁遭抢劫了？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어젯밤에","meaning":"昨夜","explanation":"어젯밤：昨夜；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"어젯밤","audio":"/audio/faa5384e3766467459a5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67078","senseId":"1","lemma":"어젯밤","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"옆집에","meaning":"邻居，隔壁","explanation":"옆집：邻居，隔壁；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"옆집","audio":"/audio/d4901559765ba929833a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71723","senseId":"1","lemma":"옆집","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"강도가","meaning":"强盗","explanation":"강도：强盗；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"강도","audio":"/audio/7866fc07b935f9a4a66b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91524","senseId":"1","lemma":"강도","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"들었다면서요?","meaning":"进去，进入","explanation":"들다：进去，进入；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；다면서요：引用所听到的陈述，再向对方确认：“听说……，是吗？”","readings":[{"term":"들다","audio":"/audio/7ff37822e89462ea5014.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71686","senseId":"1","lemma":"들다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"faa5384e37664674","term":"어젯밤","zh":"昨夜","audio":"/audio/faa5384e3766467459a5.mp3","entryId":"67078","definition":"昨天的夜晚。","pronunciation":["어제빰","어젣빰"]},{"id":"d4901559765ba929","term":"옆집","zh":"邻居，隔壁","audio":"/audio/d4901559765ba929833a.mp3","entryId":"71723","definition":"旁边的一家。","pronunciation":["엽찝"]},{"id":"7866fc07b935f9a4","term":"강도","zh":"强盗","audio":"/audio/7866fc07b935f9a4a66b.mp3","entryId":"91524","definition":"用施暴或胁迫的方式抢夺别人财物的盗贼。","pronunciation":["강ː도"]},{"id":"7ff37822e89462ea","term":"들다","zh":"进去，进入","audio":"/audio/7ff37822e89462ea5014.mp3","entryId":"71686","definition":"从外面进到里面或进来里面。","pronunciation":["들다"]}],"audio":"/audio/46d23da3aef19ed60fd9.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n90220-1-8-2","ko":"네, 우리 마을처럼 조용한 곳에서는 전무후무의 사건이죠.","zh":"是的，在我们这么安静的村子里，真是从未有过的事。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"네：是，行","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"2","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"우리","meaning":"我们，咱们","explanation":"우리：我们，咱们","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"1","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"마을처럼","meaning":"村子，村庄","explanation":"마을：村子，村庄；처럼：表示相似：“像……一样”。","readings":[{"term":"마을","audio":"/audio/16a6e53889b32d5b72f4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61099","senseId":"1","lemma":"마을","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"조용한","meaning":"安静","explanation":"조용하다：安静；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"조용하다","audio":"/audio/1cd9dc985df28c4908a7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58167","senseId":"1","lemma":"조용하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"곳에서는","meaning":"处，地方","explanation":"곳：处，地方；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"곳","audio":"/audio/24875f860934407bb8fb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"18661","senseId":"2","lemma":"곳","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"전무후무의","meaning":"空前绝后，前所未有","explanation":"전무후무：空前绝后，前所未有；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"전무후무","audio":"/audio/21e14b8bbfb79ddd961d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"90220","senseId":"1","lemma":"전무후무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"사건이죠.","meaning":"事件，案件","explanation":"사건：事件，案件；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；죠：礼貌地确认、提醒或表达意愿；죠 是 지요 的缩略。","readings":[{"term":"사건","audio":"/audio/d04be92d4a8150be63c8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15654","senseId":"1","lemma":"사건","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1c0ddfd005093840","term":"네","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3","entryId":"17294","definition":"用于肯定回答长辈所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["네"]},{"id":"398dfa639dfd0db8","term":"우리","zh":"我们，咱们","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3","entryId":"17182","definition":"说话人指代自己和听话人在内的一些人。","pronunciation":["우리"]},{"id":"16a6e53889b32d5b","term":"마을","zh":"村子，村庄","audio":"/audio/16a6e53889b32d5b72f4.mp3","entryId":"61099","definition":"多户人家聚集生活的地方。","pronunciation":["마을"]},{"id":"1cd9dc985df28c49","term":"조용하다","zh":"安静","audio":"/audio/1cd9dc985df28c4908a7.mp3","entryId":"58167","definition":"听不见任何声音。","pronunciation":["조용하다"]},{"id":"24875f860934407b","term":"곳","zh":"处，地方","audio":"/audio/24875f860934407bb8fb.mp3","entryId":"18661","definition":"抽象的地点或位置。","pronunciation":["곧"]},{"id":"21e14b8bbfb79ddd","term":"전무후무","zh":"空前绝后，前所未有","audio":"/audio/21e14b8bbfb79ddd961d.mp3","entryId":"90220","definition":"以前不曾有过，今后也不会有。","pronunciation":["전무후무"]},{"id":"d04be92d4a8150be","term":"사건","zh":"事件，案件","audio":"/audio/d04be92d4a8150be63c8.mp3","entryId":"15654","definition":"能够引发关心或瞩目的事情。","pronunciation":["사ː껀"]}],"audio":"/audio/a8c0db5f156614e40306.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.629,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=90220","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":129,"sequenceScore":2.4557,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["听说昨晚隔壁遭抢劫了？","是的，在我们这么安静的村子里，真是从未有过的事。","你为什么捂着耳朵？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["听说昨晚隔壁遭抢劫了？","是的，在我们这么安静的村子里，真是从未有过的事。","你为什么捂着耳朵？"],"answer":1}]}
